          "",
          "  gastritis     stomach + inflammation",
          "  hepatology    liver + study",
          "  enteric       gut + relating to",
          "  nephrectomy   kidney + cutting out",
          "",
          "Gastroenteritis names both organs at once:",
          "stomach and gut, inflamed together.",
          "",
